1
00:00:00,489 --> 00:00:04,059
(Penny:)So, you just left them alone
playing games in your house?

2
00:00:04,059 --> 00:00:06,059
(Dr Lorvis:)Well, they seemed happy and...

3
00:00:06,061 --> 00:00:08,061
(Man:)I thought
that would give me time

4
00:00:08,063 --> 00:00:10,933
(Dr Lorvis:)for you and I to get
to know each other better.

5
00:00:12,968 --> 00:00:16,368
(Dr Lorvis:)That was before we met.

6
00:00:17,639 --> 00:00:20,409
(Amy:)We all have a past.

7
00:00:20,409 --> 00:00:22,139
(Penny:)Doc, you've got to see what
you're doing

8
00:00:22,144 --> 00:00:24,044
is-is a little creepy.

9
00:00:24,046 --> 00:00:25,346
(Dr Lorvis:)You sound just
like Sigourney Weaver

10
00:00:25,347 --> 00:00:28,077
(Dr Lorvis:)when I followed her
into a restroom.

11
00:00:30,052 --> 00:00:31,182
(Penny:)Okay, you can't
just go chasing after

12
00:00:31,186 --> 00:00:33,086
(Penny:)every girl who's nice to you.

13
00:00:33,088 --> 00:00:34,888
(Dr Lorvis:)Well, that's not
what Sheldon says.

14
00:00:34,890 --> 00:00:37,990
(Dr Lorvis:)And he seems to know
his way around the ladies.

15
00:00:39,061 --> 00:00:41,731
(cell phone ringing)

16
00:00:41,730 --> 00:00:44,660
Hey, Leonard. Guess who's back!
Dr. Lorvis!

17
00:00:44,666 --> 00:00:46,996
(Penny(on phone):)Yeah. You care to join us?

18
00:00:47,002 --> 00:00:48,202
What?!

19
00:00:48,203 --> 00:00:49,803
(Penny(on phone):)You locked them
in your basement?!

20
00:00:51,173 --> 00:00:53,073
(Dr Lorvis:)Well, they're,
they're not locked in.

21
00:00:53,075 --> 00:00:54,605
(Dr Lorvis:)The door just sticks.

22
00:00:54,609 --> 00:00:56,839
(Penny:)Okay, so how do they unstick it?

23
00:00:56,845 --> 00:01:02,025
(Dr Lorvis:)They'd need the key.

